# PUT /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/retire — retire a person from a date. Body
# {"from":"yyyy-mm-dd"}; a blank date is the sheet's today. A date that is not real is refused with
# 400 and nothing is stored; 404 for a person not on the sheet. Retiring again moves the date. From the
# day it is reached, their open claims not bound by a statement count in no live total.
